From a5ea7436cc8d2b210bd3e5b1c93ff3bac7427972 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefane Fermigier <sf@abilian.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 15:41:23 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] 3dparty: a local cache, shared by the build trees of one
 machine

REMOTE_CACHE_TYPE=local with REMOTE_CACHE_DIR keeps each dependency's
archive in a directory, under the paths the remote caches use, so that
a new build tree on the same machine takes V8, ICU or Boost from it
instead of building them again. A dependency already built in a tree
is stored too, which a remote cache does not do. Archives are written
under a temporary name and renamed.
---
 Common/3dParty/build_3rdparty_common.py      | 19 ++++++++-
 Common/3dParty/test_build_3rdparty_common.py | 18 ++++++++
 scripts/remote_cache.py                      | 43 ++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 78 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Common/3dParty/build_3rdparty_common.py b/Common/3dParty/build_3rdparty_common.py
